<p id="concept">Median of ungrouped data, odd number of values: order then take the middle.</p>
<p id="reviewer"></p>
<p id="description">Students find the median of an odd-length list shown unordered. Diagnostics catch not sorting first, giving the position, and giving the mean.</p>]]></text>
